"settings.legal.delete_account" = "Delete Account";
"settings.legal.support.body" = "Super X is a free app. It has no support desk and no support email address. Most problems come from the playlist or the provider subscription you added: check that your sign-in details are entered exactly as your provider gave them, and that your subscription is still active. Questions about your subscription, its content or its renewal can only be answered by your provider.";
"settings.legal.report.body" = "Super X does not provide any channels, movies or series. Everything you watch comes from the playlist and the provider subscription you added yourself, and it is hosted and supplied by that provider. If some of that content is objectionable or infringes your rights, the effective place to report it is your provider. On this device you can also hide adult content with Parental Controls in Settings, and removing the playlist removes that content from this device.";
"settings.legal.privacy.body" = "Data collection\n\nThis application does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data or user information.\n\nYour content\n\n• IPTV playlists and channel lists are stored locally on your device only.\n• No data is sent to external servers by the app itself. When you play a stream, your device connects directly to the provider you added.\n• No analytics or tracking services are used.\n\nThird-party services\n\nThis application does not integrate with any third-party analytics, advertising, or data collection services.\n\nChanges\n\nIf this policy changes, the updated text will appear here, in the app.";
"settings.legal.terms.body" = "1. The app\n\nSuper X is a free media player. It contains no channels, movies, series or other content of its own, and it sells nothing.\n\n2. Your playlists and subscriptions\n\nYou add your own playlists and provider subscriptions. Your agreement with a provider — including its price, expiry date and content — is between you and that provider. When a provider subscription expires, playback of that provider's content stops until you renew it or switch playlists.\n\n3. Your responsibility\n\nYou are responsible for making sure you have the right to access and watch the content you add to the app.\n\n4. No warranty\n\nThe app is provided \"as is\", without warranties of any kind. Super X is not responsible for the availability, quality or legality of content supplied by third-party providers.";

